# Build context for backend/Dockerfile (the repository root). The frontend image uses frontend/.dockerignore.
# Only backend/ and the certificate logo are needed; everything else slows down or bloats the build.
.git
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.venv
**/dist
**/.coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
backend/uploads
qa
docs
frontend/*
!frontend/src/assets/logo_cert.png
